<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Elemental Shaman</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool and drop item level 553 Tier 16.<br/>
<br/>They also drop Prideful Gladiator PvP gear (ilvl 550), which fills off-slots with high ilvl items whilst you progress toward raids.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos drops plenty of strong pre-raid pieces, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105763/penates-perilous-pendant">
<img alt="Penate's Perilous Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_mop6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Penate's Perilous Pendant</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105764/rising-new-moon-talisman">
<img alt="Rising New Moon Talisman" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_mop5.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rising New Moon Talisman</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105784/binkensteins-burnished-belt">
<img alt="Binkenstein's Burnished Belt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mail_raidshaman_n_01belt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Binkenstein's Burnished Belt</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105771/chestguard-of-pyrrhic-immolation">
<img alt="Chestguard of Pyrrhic Immolation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mail_raidshaman_n_01chest.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestguard of Pyrrhic Immolation</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105790/firetotem-bracers">
<img alt="Firetotem Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mail_raidshaman_n_01bracer.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firetotem Bracers</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105799/fleshsmoke-chain-shoulders">
<img alt="Fleshsmoke Chain Shoulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mail_raidshaman_n_01shoulder.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fleshsmoke Chain Shoulders</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105755/moshnes-keen-kilt">
<img alt="Moshne's Keen Kilt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mail_raidshaman_n_01pant.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moshne's Keen Kilt</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105811/olivias-graceful-gaze">
<img alt="Olivia's Graceful Gaze" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_pvpshaman_g_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Olivia's Graceful Gaze</span></a>. These are fairly rare, but you should use them in place of Celestial Gear for the most part if they drop for you, unless it means dropping tier set bonuses.<br/>
<br/>Access to Ordos is strictly gated behind the Legendary Cloak questline. You must have the cloak (or have completed the quest on your account) to enter the sanctuary and receive loot.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_staff_2h_pandarenmonk_c_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Timeless Isle Items for Elemental Shaman</span></h2>The Timeless Isle in Phase 5 is a great place to catch up on gear. You will earn <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=777/timeless-coin">
<span>
<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a> for almost all activities that you participate in. <br/>
<br/>This can be used to buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104010/timeless-mail-armor-cache">
<img alt="Timeless Mail Armor Cache" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bag_33.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Mail Armor Cache</span></a>, which rewards the player with a piece of gear, depending on the loot specialization they currently have selected, that ranges from a 496 item level to a 535 (lower chance).<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Elemental Shaman Pre-Raid Trinkets in Phase 5</span></h2>
<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>While the specific type of trinket (active vs. passive) isn't overly critical for Shamans, passive trinkets are inherently easier to use and maintain uptime on, making them ideal for players who may forget to use actives or have inconsistent cooldown alignment.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104924/purified-bindings-of-immerseus">
<img alt="Purified Bindings of Immerseus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Bindings of Immerseus</span></a> is the best trinket available for Elemental Shaman in Phase 5 as it provides a massive amount of static Intellect and a unique passive effect that amplifies your Haste, Mastery, and Critical Strike from all sources by a percentage. Because it scales with your other gear, it increases the value of every other piece of equipment you own.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105042/kardris-toxic-totem">
<img alt="Kardris' Toxic Totem" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kardris' Toxic Totem</span></a> has a strong Intellect proc and a great effect that multiplies the effect of your spells, in a similar way to <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=77222/mastery-elemental-overload">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_lightningoverload.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mastery: Elemental Overload</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105150/black-blood-of-yshaarj">
<img alt="Black Blood of Y'Shaarj" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Black Blood of Y'Shaarj</span></a> is also a good trinket due to having passive Haste and its large Intellect proc that increases in power every second for 10 seconds.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="legendary-cloak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendary_theblackprince.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Legendary Cloak for Elemental Shaman</span></h2>In Phase 5, you can at last finish the Legendary Quest Line and earn your Legendary Cloak. <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102246/xing-ho-breath-of-yulon">
<img alt="Xing-Ho, Breath of Yu'lon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_dragoncaster_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Xing-Ho, Breath of Yu'lon</span></a> is the legendary caster cloak in Mists of Pandaria. Its proc contributes approximately 3% of total DPS.<br/>
<br/>The damage dealt by this proc is categorized as a direct hit, meaning it can trigger damage-based effects (such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96558/unerring-vision-of-lei-shen">
<img alt="Unerring Vision of Lei Shen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_focusedaim.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unerring Vision of Lei Shen</span></a>)<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Elemental Shamans</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="emperor-shaohao">
